OAUTH2 Change Log version (1.1-1 ) Tue, 31 Dec 2024 14:50 +0000

1. Avoid raising an exception when server returns a JSON null value (e.g. scope: null). A null value is now
   interpreted as an empty string or a 0 depending on the property type.

